        "source_quote": "Mexico’s environmental department, SEMARNAT, approved Cordero’s environmental impact assessment and Change of Land Use permit, completing the project’s federal environmental approval process, Discovery said Monday in a statement . Discovery still needs to complete development planning and financing before construction can begin.",
